# Force LF for shell scripts regardless of the checking-out machine's
# core.autocrlf setting. On Windows, a CRLF checkout breaks native execution
# under WSL/Linux (shebang lines like "#!/usr/bin/env bash\r" fail to
# resolve) — this bit us during development of network/bootstrap.sh. See
# docs/adr/0001-fase1-spike-scope.md and the README's Troubleshooting section.
*.sh text eol=lf
